6. Known issue
==============

1. For qspi secure boot on RDB3, the board boot will fail after executing
   secure boot command. The SDK has the same issue, and there is a ticket
   to vendor to track the status:
        https://community.nxp.com/t5/S32G/QSPI-secboot-failed-with-SDK-BSP43-secboot-image-on-RDB3/m-p/2067085#M13051
